      "sourceTextSha256": "ca6bc3aa47b5706222d3f24042b7cd5656930c27a61c634a854c5234a05597f2",
      "text": "Day 1 · Arrival in Lima, meeting at the airport with a guide and transfer to the hotel; after check-in, the day is at leisure. Peru’s capital and largest city, on the Pacific coast, was founded in 1535 by Francisco Pizarro as the “Ciudad de los Reyes” (City of Kings), and its historic centre is a UNESCO World Heritage Site. A city of great cultural diversity and many museums, Lima is also renowned worldwide for its cuisine, with countless restaurants and bars where you can taste Peruvian dishes and drinks.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "word_exact",
        "fileId": "1DlvieRFQtbPhDADN4y0-elcPotlc5xVc",
