      "sourceTextSha256": "10e9b323c5de73ab9a9c06f04127942e0f8ac3392597c486de6c3bb0028ae2a4",
      "text": "Day 2 · After breakfast, guided tour of the main colonial sights: the Main Square with the Cathedral, the San Francisco Convent and many elegant buildings with restored traditional wooden balconies. Continue to the residential districts of San Isidro, with its Olive Grove, Country Club and golf course, and Miraflores, with its Central Park, City Hall and shopping streets such as Avenida Larco. Return to the hotel.",
